  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "Carbonate Chemistry of the Bering Sea",
  "description": "Concurrent oxygen, pH, and calcium total alkalinity were measured in the eastern Bering Sea in the late winter of 1983. The carbon fluxes were estimated.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: To collect data in the winter, to estimate the anthropogenic CO2 sequestered in the Bering Sea.",
